# Equipment (validation 3), enemy HP: an enemy's HP loss is the battle damage the core computes
# for the enemy side, so doubling and halving apply to HP exactly once, and a doubled hit that
# empties HP is a normal battle destruction (decided at damage calculation, not afterwards).
#   plain Dark Magician 2500 vs 岩殼守衛 DEF 2000      500
#   equipped Dark Magician                              500 x2 = 1000
#   Susa Soldier 2000 (halves its own damage) vs 稻草人 DEF 500: 1500 / 2 = 750
#   equipped Celtic 1400 vs the other 稻草人 (HP 1500): 900 x2 = 1800 -> destroyed by battle
start_draw 0 0
start_draw 1 0
draw_per_turn 1 0
card 0 mzone 46986414       # placement 0: Dark Magician, equipped
card 0 mzone 46986414       # 1: Dark Magician
card 0 mzone 91152256       # 2: Celtic Guardian, equipped
card 0 mzone 40473581       # 3: Susa Soldier
card 0 deck 15025844 x10
card 1 mzone 990000001 fu_def
card 1 mzone 990000002 fu_def
card 1 mzone 990000002 fu_def
equip 0 placement 0 990000202
equip 0 placement 2 990000202

0 idle end
1 idle end
0 idle battle
0 battle attack 46986414@mzone[1]
0 select 990000001
expect hp 990000001 2700 3200
0 battle attack 46986414@mzone[0]
0 select 990000001
expect hp 990000001 1700
0 battle attack 40473581
0 select 990000002@mzone[1]
expect hp 990000002 750 1500
0 battle attack 91152256
0 select 990000002@mzone[2]
expect hp 990000002 0
expect destroyed 990000002 battle
expect count 1 mzone 2
expect lp 1 8000
stop
